\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\outlinelevel0\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \scaps\f1\ul\lang1036\kerning28\cgrid {sissi\par }\pard\plain \s16\qj\li2835\sa120\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {Il va beaucoup }{\cf6 mieux\~}{! Je le raccompagne dans sa chambre.\par }\pard\plain \s18\qj\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {Froncement de sourcils de l\rquote infirmi\u232\'8fre.\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s20 \scaps\f1\kerning28 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 55 - \tab}}\pard\plain \s20\qj\li2835\sb120\keepn\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\outlinelevel0\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \scaps\f1\ul\lang1036\kerning28\cgrid {l\rquote infirmi\u232\'8fre\par }\pard\plain \s16\qj\li2835\sa120\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {Tu es s\u251\'9er, Ulrich ?\par }\pard\plain \s18\qj\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {Ulrich acquiesce, h\u233\'8esitant.\~\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s20 \scaps\f1\kerning28 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 56 - \tab}}\pard\plain \s20\qj\li2835\sb120\keepn\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\outlinelevel0\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \scaps\f1\ul\lang1036\kerning28\cgrid {ulrich\par }\pard\plain \s16\qj\li2835\sa120\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {Heu\u8230\'c9 oui\u8230\'c9 je\u8230\'c9 je me sens mieux\~!\par }\pard\plain \s18\qj\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {Sissi lui sourit en hochant la t\u234\'90te, et continue de l\rquote entra\u238\'94ner vers la sortie.\par {\pntext\pard\plain\s17 \b\caps\f1 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 8.\tab}}\pard\plain \s17\qj\fi-360\li360\sb240\sa120\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx360{\*\pn \pnlvlbody\ilvl0\ls2\pnrnot0\pndec\pnstart1\pnindent360\pnsp120\pnhang{\pntxta .}}\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls2\adjustright\rin0\lin360\itap0 \b\caps\f1\ul\lang1036\cgrid {ext. infirmerie \endash  jour\par }\pard\plain \s18\qj\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {Ulrich et Sissi quittent l\rquote infirmerie au moment o\u249\'9d Jim arrive, portant une \u233\'8el\u232\'8fve dans ses bras. Il s\rquote agit de la jeune fille au biscuit (s\u233\'8eq. #3). Les deux ados s\rquote arr\u234\'90tent pour le regarder. Pr\u233\'8eoccup\u233\'8e, Jim ne les remarque pas.\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s20 \scaps\f1\kerning28 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 57 - \tab}}\pard\plain \s20\qj\li2835\sb120\keepn\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\outlinelevel0\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \scaps\f1\ul\lang1036\kerning28\cgrid {jim (pour lui-m\u234\'90me)\par }\pard\plain \s16\qj\li2835\sa120\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {C\rquote est une \u233\'8epid\u233\'8emie ou quoi\~?\par }\pard\plain \s18\qj\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {Ulrich et Sissi se retournent pour regarder, inquiets, passer Jim, mais Sissi l\rquote entra\u238\'94ne de nouveau.\par {\pntext\pard\plain\s17 \b\caps\f1 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 9.\tab}}\pard\plain \s17\qj\fi-360\li360\sb240\sa120\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx360{\*\pn \pnlvlbody\ilvl0\ls2\pnrnot0\pndec\pnstart1\pnindent360\pnsp120\pnhang{\pntxta .}}\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls2\adjustright\rin0\lin360\itap0 \b\caps\f1\ul\lang1036\cgrid {ext. cour de r\u233\'8ecr\u233\'8eation - jour\par }\pard\plain \s18\qj\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {Sissi et Ulrich arrivent dans la cour de r\u233\'8ecr\u233\'8eation, et la jeune fille lui prend aussit\u244\'99t la main en souriant, victorieuse. \par Plus loin, elle aper\u231\'8doit les amis d'Ulrich et perd son sourire. Les choses ne seront peut-\u234\'90tre pas si faciles. Elle semble r\u233\'8efl\u233\'8echir un instant, puis s\rquote arr\u234\'90te et les d\u233\'8esigne \u224\'88 Ulrich.\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s20 \scaps\f1\kerning28 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 58 - \tab}}\pard\plain \s20\qj\li2835\sb120\keepn\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\outlinelevel0\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \scaps\f1\ul\lang1036\kerning28\cgrid {ulrich\par }\pard\plain \s16\qj\li2835\sa120\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {Tu vois ces trois-l\u224\'88\~? Ce sont tes pires ennemis\~!\par }\pard\plain \s18\qj\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {Ulrich les regarde, surpris.\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s20 \scaps\f1\kerning28 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 59 - \tab}}\pard\plain \s20\qj\li2835\sb120\keepn\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\outlinelevel0\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \scaps\f1\ul\lang1036\kerning28\cgrid {ulrich\par }\pard\plain \s16\qj\li2835\sa120\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {Ah\~?\u8230\'c9 Pourquoi\~?!\par }\pard\plain \s18\qj\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {Plan sur les trois amis qui aper\u231\'8doivent Ulrich.\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s20 \scaps\f1\kerning28 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 60 - \tab}}\pard\plain \s20\qj\li2835\sb120\keepn\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\outlinelevel0\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \scaps\f1\ul\lang1036\kerning28\cgrid {odd\par }\pard\plain \s16\qj\li2835\sa120\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {H\u233\'8e\~!! Voil\u224\'88 Ulrich\~!!\par }\pard\plain \s18\qj\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {Mais ils remarquent en m\u234\'90me temps qui lui tient compagnie.\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s20 \scaps\f1\kerning28 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 61 - \tab}}\pard\plain \s20\qj\li2835\sb120\keepn\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\outlinelevel0\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \scaps\f1\ul\lang1036\kerning28\cgrid {yumi\par }\pard\plain \s16\qj\li2835\sa120\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {Je r\u234\'90ve\~! Qu\rquote est-ce qu\rquote il fait avec Sissi ??!!\par }\pard\plain \s18\qj\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {Les trois amis s\rquote approchent de lui et l\rquote accostent. Odd, ravi, lui donne une claque amicale dans le dos.\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s20 \scaps\f1\kerning28 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 62 - \tab}}\pard\plain \s20\qj\li2835\sb120\keepn\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\outlinelevel0\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \scaps\f1\ul\lang1036\kerning28\cgrid {odd\par }\pard\plain \s16\qj\li2835\sa120\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {Alors vieux\~? Tu te sens mieux\~?\par }\pard\plain \s18\qj\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {Ulrich jette un \u339\'cfil sur la main d\rquote Odd pos\u233\'8ee sur son \u233\'8epaule, puis regarde l\rquote adolescent en faisant un mouvement d\rquote \u233\'8epaule.\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s20 \scaps\f1\kerning28 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 63 - \tab}}\pard\plain \s20\qj\li2835\sb120\keepn\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\outlinelevel0\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \scaps\f1\ul\lang1036\kerning28\cgrid {ulrich\par }\pard\plain \s16\qj\li2835\sa120\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {Eh\u8230\'c9 T\rquote es qui toi\~?\~L\u226\'89che-moi, t\rquote entends\~!\par }\pard\plain \s18\qj\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {Odd, Yumi et J\u233\'8er\u233\'8emie sont sid\u233\'8er\u233\'8es. Instinctivement, Odd retire sa main.\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s20 \scaps\f1\kerning28 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 64 - \tab}}\pard\plain \s20\qj\li2835\sb120\keepn\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\outlinelevel0\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \scaps\f1\ul\lang1036\kerning28\cgrid {odd (troubl\u233\'8e)\par }\pard\plain \s16\qj\li2835\sa120\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {Mais\u8230\'c9 enfin Ulrich\u8230\'c9 c\rquote est moi, Odd !\par }\pard\plain \s18\qj\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {Ulrich d\u233\'8evisage Odd sans sembler le reconna\u238\'94tre.\par Sissi en profite pour prendre la main et le tirer vers elle.\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s20 \scaps\f1\kerning28 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 65 - \tab}}\pard\plain \s20\qj\li2835\sb120\keepn\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\outlinelevel0\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \scaps\f1\ul\lang1036\kerning28\cgrid {sissi\par }\pard\plain \s16\qj\li2835\sa120\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {Bon\u8230\'c9 \u231\'8da suffit\~! Ulrich en a juste marre de vous\~! Alors l\u226\'89chez-nous, pig\u233\'8e\~?!\par }\pard\plain \s18\qj\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {Sur ce, Sissi entra\u238\'94ne Ulrich par la main. Ce dernier, toujours d\u233\'8eboussol\u233\'8e, se laisse faire.\par J\u233\'8er\u233\'8emie, Odd et Yumi, sid\u233\'8er\u233\'8es, restent interdits en le regardant s\rquote \u233\'8eloigner.\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s20 \scaps\f1\kerning28 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 66 - \tab}}\pard\plain \s20\qj\li2835\sb120\keepn\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\outlinelevel0\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \scaps\f1\ul\lang1036\kerning28\cgrid {Odd\par }\pard\plain \s16\qj\li2835\sa120\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {Ben qu\rquote est-ce qui lui prend\~?\par }\pard\plain \s18\qj\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {Troubl\u233\'8es, ils regardent Ulrich qui, plus loin, sert la main d\rquote Herv\u233\'8e et de Nicolas.\par \par Plan sur Sissi qui pr\u233\'8esente ses deux sbires \u224\'88 son \u171\'c7\~amoureux\~\u187\'c8.\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s20 \scaps\f1\kerning28 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 67 - \tab}}\pard\plain \s20\qj\li2835\sb120\keepn\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\outlinelevel0\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \scaps\f1\ul\lang1036\kerning28\cgrid {sissi\par }\pard\plain \s16\qj\li2835\sa120\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {Ulrich, voici Herv\u233\'8e et Nicolas, tes meilleurs copains\~!\par }\pard\plain \s18\qj\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {Ulrich hoche la t\u234\'90te en signe de salut. \par Bien s\u251\'9er, Herv\u233\'8e et Nicolas ouvrent des yeux ronds de surprise. \par Sissi leur fait des signes insistants.\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s20 \scaps\f1\kerning28 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 68 - \tab}}\pard\plain \s20\qj\li2835\sb120\keepn\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\outlinelevel0\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \scaps\f1\ul\lang1036\kerning28\cgrid {sissi\par }\pard\plain \s16\qj\li2835\sa120\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {Ulrich a comme un petit trou de m\u233\'8emoire !\par }\pard\plain \s18\qj\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {Sans comprendre, les deux nigauds hochent la t\u234\'90te, davantage pour ne pas d\u233\'8ecevoir Sissi que par conviction.\par Ulrich remarque la petite bouteille de soda que tient Herv\u233\'8e et tend la main vers elle.\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s20 \scaps\f1\kerning28 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 69 - \tab}}\pard\plain \s20\qj\li2835\sb120\keepn\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\outlinelevel0\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \scaps\f1\ul\lang1036\kerning28\cgrid {ulrich\par }\pard\plain \s16\qj\li2835\sa120\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {Je peux\~? J\rquote ai super soif.\par }\pard\plain \s18\qj\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {Surpris, Herv\u233\'8e regarde sa canette et la tend \u224\'88 Ulrich qui la prend et s\rquote empresse de boire une longue gorg\u233\'8ee au goulot. \par Sissi prend Ulrich par la main.\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s20 \scaps\f1\kerning28 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 70 - \tab}}\pard\plain \s20\qj\li2835\sb120\keepn\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\outlinelevel0\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \scaps\f1\ul\lang1036\kerning28\cgrid {sissi\par }\pard\plain \s16\qj\li2835\sa120\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {Et si on allait marcher un peu dans le parc\~? \u199\'82a te ferait du bien.\par }\pard\plain \s18\qj\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {Ulrich rend la bouteille \u224\'88 Herv\u233\'8e, qui la soup\u232\'8fse d\rquote un air perplexe.\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s20 \scaps\f1\kerning28 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 71 - \tab}}\pard\plain \s20\qj\li2835\sb120\keepn\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\outlinelevel0\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \scaps\f1\ul\lang1036\kerning28\cgrid {ulrich\par }\pard\plain \s16\qj\li2835\sa120\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {Merci.\par }\pard\plain \s18\qj\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {\u8230\'c9et se laisse de nouveau entra\u238\'94ner par Sissi.\par Tandis que Nicolas regarde les deux amoureux s\rquote \u233\'8eloigner, Herv\u233\'8e porte la canette \u224\'88 ses l\u232\'8fvres et boit \u224\'88 son tour.\par La cam\u233\'8era resserre sur le goulot de la cannette, jusqu\rquote \u224\'88 une vue microscopique : les nano virus passent dans sa bouche.\par \par Plus loin, Odd, J\u233\'8er\u233\'8emie et Yumi voient Herv\u233\'8e boire \u224\'88 la bouteille (sans y pr\u234\'90ter d'attention particuli\u232\'8fre) et en arri\u232\'8fre plan, Ulrich et Sissi s\rquote \u233\'8eloigner vers le parc.\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s20 \scaps\f1\kerning28 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 72 - \tab}}\pard\plain \s20\qj\li2835\sb120\keepn\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\outlinelevel0\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \scaps\f1\ul\lang1036\kerning28\cgrid {Odd\par }\pard\plain \s16\qj\li2835\sa120\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {C\rquote est fou\~! Il ne m\rquote a pas reconnu\~! Il est amn\u233\'8esique ou quoi\~?\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s20 \scaps\f1\kerning28 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 73 - \tab}}\pard\plain \s20\qj\li2835\sb120\keepn\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\outlinelevel0\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \scaps\f1\ul\lang1036\kerning28\cgrid {Yumi\par }\pard\plain \s16\qj\li2835\sa120\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {On dirait bien\u8230\'c9 Si on allait en parler \u224\'88 l\rquote infirmi\u232\'8fre\~!?\par }\pard\plain \s18\qj\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {J\u233\'8er\u233\'8emie acquiesce. \par {\listtext\pard\plain\s20 \scaps\f1\kerning28 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 74 - \tab}}\pard\plain \s20\qj\li2835\sb120\keepn\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\outlinelevel0\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \scaps\f1\ul\lang1036\kerning28\cgrid {J\u233\'8er\u233\'8emie\par }\pard\plain \s16\qj\li2835\sa120\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {Bonne id\u233\'8ee\~!\par }\pard\plain \s18\qj\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {Odd d\u233\'8esigne la direction dans laquelle Ulrich s\rquote est \u233\'8eloign\u233\'8e avec Sissi.\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s20 \scaps\f1\kerning28 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 75 - \tab}}\pard\plain \s20\qj\li2835\sb120\keepn\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\outlinelevel0\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \scaps\f1\ul\lang1036\kerning28\cgrid {odd\par }\pard\plain \s16\qj\li2835\sa120\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {Moi, je vais quand m\u234\'90me essayer de le ramener \u224\'88 la raison ! Ulrich qui }{\cf6 tra\u238\'94ne}{ avec Sissi\u8230\'c9 bonjour l\rquote angoisse\~!\par }\pard\plain \s18\qj\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {Les amis se s\u233\'8eparent en deux groupes\~: J\u233\'8er\u233\'8emie et Yumi vont vers l\rquote infirmerie, et Odd vers le parc.\par {\pntext\pard\plain\s17 \b\caps\f1 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 10.\tab}}\pard\plain \s17\qj\fi-360\li360\sb240\sa120\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx360{\*\pn \pnlvlbody\ilvl0\ls2\pnrnot0\pndec\pnstart1\pnindent360\pnsp120\pnhang{\pntxta .}}\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls2\adjustright\rin0\lin360\itap0 \b\caps\f1\ul\lang1036\cgrid {ext. parc - jour\par }\pard\plain \s18\qj\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {Odd se faufile entre deux bosquets et s\rquote arr\u234\'90te non loin de Sissi et Ulrich, assis sur un banc dans le parc. \par Odd les observe discr\u232\'8ftement. \par Sissi ouvre un paquet de biscuits, et en tend un \u224\'88 Ulrich qui commence \u224\'88 le grignoter.\par Sissi, minaudant \u224\'88 qui mieux mieux, passe ses bras autour du cou d\rquote Ulrich.\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s20 \scaps\f1\kerning28 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 76 - \tab}}\pard\plain \s20\qj\li2835\sb120\keepn\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\outlinelevel0\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \scaps\f1\ul\lang1036\kerning28\cgrid {sissi\par }\pard\plain \s16\qj\li2835\sa120\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {Alors\u8230\'c9 qu\rquote est-ce que \u231\'8da te fait de sortir avec la plus belle fille du coll\u232\'8fge\~? \par }\pard\plain \s18\qj\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {Ulrich, qui semble de plus en plus embarrass\u233\'8e par l\rquote attitude de Sissi, retire les bras de la jeune fille d\rquote autour son cou.\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s20 \scaps\f1\kerning28 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 77 - \tab}}\pard\plain \s20\qj\li2835\sb120\keepn\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\outlinelevel0\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \scaps\f1\ul\lang1036\kerning28\cgrid {ulrich\par }\pard\plain \s16\qj\li2835\sa120\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {Heu\u8230\'c9 franchement\~? Rien. \par }\pard\plain \s18\qj\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {Mine stup\u233\'8efaite et vex\u233\'8ee de Sissi.\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s20 \scaps\f1\kerning28 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 78 - \tab}}\pard\plain \s20\qj\li2835\sb120\keepn\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\outlinelevel0\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \scaps\f1\ul\lang1036\kerning28\cgrid {Sissi\par }\pard\plain \s16\qj\li2835\sa120\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {Quoi\~? \par }\pard\plain \s18\qj\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {Ulrich se l\u232\'8fve et la regarde, s\u233\'8erieux.\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s20 \scaps\f1\kerning28 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 79 - \tab}}\pard\plain \s20\qj\li2835\sb120\keepn\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\outlinelevel0\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \scaps\f1\ul\lang1036\kerning28\cgrid {Ulrich\par }\pard\plain \s16\qj\li2835\sa120\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {C'est-\u224\'88-dire que\u8230\'c9 t\rquote es pas du tout mon genre !\par }\pard\plain \s19\qj\sb120\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \scaps\f1\ul\lang1036\cgrid {Plan de coupe sur le visage hilare et satisfait d\rquote Odd.\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s20 \scaps\f1\kerning28 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 80 - \tab}}\pard\plain \s20\qj\li2835\sb120\keepn\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\outlinelevel0\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \scaps\f1\ul\lang1036\kerning28\cgrid {Odd (pour lui-m\u234\'90me)\par }\pard\plain \s16\qj\li2835\sa120\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {Ah\u8230\'c9 il a quand m\u234\'90me gard\u233\'8e un atome de lucidit\u233\'8e\~!\par }\pard\plain \s19\qj\sb120\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \scaps\f1\ul\lang1036\cgrid {retour sur Ulrich qui parle \u224\'88 Sissi.\par }\pard\plain \s18\qj\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {Bless\u233\'8ee, Sissi le fixe dans les yeux. \par Embarrass\u233\'8e, Ulrich tourne la t\u234\'90te et aper\u231\'8doit alors Odd qui le surveille.\par Ulrich l\u226\'89che son biscuit entam\u233\'8e sur la jupe de Sissi\u8230\'c9 \par {\listtext\pard\plain\s20 \scaps\f1\kerning28 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 81 - \tab}}\pard\plain \s20\qj\li2835\sb120\keepn\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\outlinelevel0\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \scaps\f1\ul\lang1036\kerning28\cgrid {Ulrich\par }\pard\plain \s16\qj\li2835\sa120\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {Eh\~! Qu\rquote est-ce que tu fais l\u224\'88, toi\~?! Tu m\rquote espionnes\~? \par }\pard\plain \s18\qj\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {Ulrich se dirige vers Odd, agressif.\par Odd se redresse et sourit \u224\'88 son ami tout en reculant, un peu inquiet malgr\u233\'8e tout.\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s20 \scaps\f1\kerning28 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 82 - \tab}}\pard\plain \s20\qj\li2835\sb120\keepn\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\outlinelevel0\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \scaps\f1\ul\lang1036\kerning28\cgrid {Odd\par }\pard\plain \s16\qj\li2835\sa120\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {Heu\u8230\'c9 non\~! \par {\listtext\pard\plain\s20 \scaps\f1\kerning28 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 83 - \tab}}\pard\plain \s20\qj\li2835\sb120\keepn\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\outlinelevel0\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \scaps\f1\ul\lang1036\kerning28\cgrid {Ulrich\par }\pard\plain \s16\qj\li2835\sa120\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {Menteur\~!\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s20 \scaps\f1\kerning28 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 84 - \tab}}\pard\plain \s20\qj\li2835\sb120\keepn\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\outlinelevel0\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \scaps\f1\ul\lang1036\kerning28\cgrid {Odd\par }\pard\plain \s16\qj\li2835\sa120\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {Ulrich\u8230\'c9 arr\u234\'90te\~! On est pote, toi et moi !\par }\pard\plain \s18\qj\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {Ulrich marche toujours droit vers Odd.\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s20 \scaps\f1\kerning28 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 85 - \tab}}\pard\plain \s20\qj\li2835\sb120\keepn\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\outlinelevel0\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \scaps\f1\ul\lang1036\kerning28\cgrid {Ulrich\par }\pard\plain \s16\qj\li2835\sa120\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {\cf6 Je ne sais pas qui tu es}{\~! Alors du vent ! J\rquote ai pas envie de te parler\~!\par }\pard\plain \s18\qj\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {Odd finit pour faire demi-tour\u8230\'c9\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s20 \scaps\f1\kerning28 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 86 - \tab}}\pard\plain \s20\qj\li2835\sb120\keepn\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\outlinelevel0\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \scaps\f1\ul\lang1036\kerning28\cgrid {Odd\par }\pard\plain \s16\qj\li2835\sa120\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {Ok\u8230\'c9 ok\u8230\'c9\par }\pard\plain \s18\qj\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {Odd s\rquote \u233\'8eloigne en courant.\par Ulrich le regarde partir, mais est soudain pris d\rquote un nouveau malaise. Il se retient \u224\'88 un arbre pour ne pas tomber, et ferme les yeux.\par {\pntext\pard\plain\s17 \b\caps\f1 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 11.\tab}}\pard\plain \s17\qj\fi-360\li360\sb240\sa120\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx360{\*\pn \pnlvlbody\ilvl0\ls2\pnrnot0\pndec\pnstart1\pnindent360\pnsp120\pnhang{\pntxta .}}\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls2\adjustright\rin0\lin360\itap0 \b\caps\f1\ul\lang1036\cgrid {flash  d\rquote ulrich \endash  int salle des f\u234\'90tes - jour\par }\pard\plain \s19\qj\sb120\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \scaps\f1\ul\lang1036\cgrid {r\u233\'8eut \u233\'8episode \u171\'c7\~Clap de fin\~\u187\'c8\par }\pard\plain \s15\qj\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {\i Yumi, Ulrich, Odd et J\u233\'8er\u233\'8emie sont assis au milieu de dizaines d\rquote autres coll\u233\'8egiens pour une s\u233\'8eance de cin\u233\'8ema exceptionnelle.\par Alors qu\rquote on entend en fond la musique de fin du g\u233\'8en\u233\'8erique, Ulrich souffle un grand coup visiblement impressionn\u233\'8e.\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s1 \i\scaps\f1\kerning28 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 87 - \tab}}\pard\plain \s1\qj\li2835\sb120\keepn\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\outlinelevel0\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \scaps\f1\ul\lang1036\kerning28\cgrid {\i ULRICH\par }\pard\plain \s16\qj\li2835\sa120\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {\i G\u233\'8e-nial\u8230\'c9\~!\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s1 \i\scaps\f1\kerning28 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 88 - \tab}}\pard\plain \s1\qj\li2835\sb120\keepn\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\outlinelevel0\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \scaps\f1\ul\lang1036\kerning28\cgrid {\i ODD (blas\u233\'8e)\par }\pard\plain \s16\qj\li2835\sa120\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {\i Mouais\u8230\'c9 Les FX sont pas mal\u8230\'c9 Mais, \u231\'8da fait pas vraiment peur\u8230\'c9\par }\pard\plain \s18\qj\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {\i Yumi se tourne vers lui, amus\u233\'8ee.\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s1 \i\scaps\f1\kerning28 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 89 - \tab}}\pard\plain \s1\qj\li2835\sb120\keepn\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\outlinelevel0\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \scaps\f1\ul\lang1036\kerning28\cgrid {\i YUMI (ironique)\par }\pard\plain \s16\qj\li2835\sa120\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {\i C\rquote est marrant\~! J\rquote ai le bruit de tes dents qui claquent dans mon oreille gauche\u8230\'c9\par }\pard\plain \s18\qj\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {\i Moue d\u233\'8epit\u233\'8ee de Odd. \par {\pntext\pard\plain\s17 \b\caps\f1 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 12.\tab}}\pard\plain \s17\qj\fi-360\li360\sb240\sa120\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx360{\*\pn \pnlvlbody\ilvl0\ls2\pnrnot0\pndec\pnstart1\pnindent360\pnsp120\pnhang{\pntxta .}}\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls2\adjustright\rin0\lin360\itap0 \b\caps\f1\ul\lang1036\cgrid {ext. parc \endash  jour\par }\pard\plain \s18\qj\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {Retour au pr\u233\'8esent.\par Sissi s\rquote est approch\u233\'8ee d\rquote Ulrich pour le soutenir. Elle semble tr\u232\'8fs inqui\u232\'8fte. Elle commence \u224\'88 l\rquote entra\u238\'94ner vers le banc. Ulrich tourne la t\u234\'90te tout de m\u234\'90me pour regarder, perplexe, Odd s\rquote \u233\'8eloigner au loin.\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s20 \scaps\f1\kerning28 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 90 - \tab}}\pard\plain \s20\qj\li2835\sb120\keepn\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\outlinelevel0\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \scaps\f1\ul\lang1036\kerning28\cgrid {sissi\par }\pard\plain \s16\qj\li2835\sa120\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {Ulrich\~? \u199\'82a va\~? Viens t\rquote asseoir. Tu dois te reposer.\par }\pard\plain \s18\qj\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {Mais Ulrich se d\u233\'8egage et la regarde avec un triste sourire.\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s20 \scaps\f1\kerning28 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 91 - \tab}}\pard\plain \s20\qj\li2835\sb120\keepn\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\outlinelevel0\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \scaps\f1\ul\lang1036\kerning28\cgrid {ulrich\par }\pard\plain \s16\qj\li2835\sa120\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {Excuse-moi mais j\rquote ai besoin d\rquote \u234\'90tre un peu seul.\par }\pard\plain \s18\qj\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {Il tourne les talons vers le parc. \par Sissi le regarde s\rquote \u233\'8eloigner en soupirant. Enfin, elle regarde le biscuit qu\rquote elle tient toujours dans la main, et mord dedans.\par \par La cam\u233\'8era zoome dramatiquement vers le biscuit.\par {\pntext\pard\plain\s17 \b\caps\f1 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 13.\tab}}\pard\plain \s17\qj\fi-360\li360\sb240\sa120\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx360{\*\pn \pnlvlbody\ilvl0\ls2\pnrnot0\pndec\pnstart1\pnindent360\pnsp120\pnhang{\pntxta .}}\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls2\adjustright\rin0\lin360\itap0 \b\caps\f1\ul\lang1036\cgrid {int. infirmerie \endash  jour\par }\pard\plain \s18\qj\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {Quelques \u233\'8el\u232\'8fves sont allong\u233\'8es sur tous les lits, inconscients. \par L\rquote infirmi\u232\'8fre, paniqu\u233\'8ee, court de lit en lit. \par Yumi et J\u233\'8er\u233\'8emie trottinent derri\u232\'8fre elle.\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s20 \scaps\f1\kerning28 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 92 - \tab}}\pard\plain \s20\qj\li2835\sb120\keepn\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\outlinelevel0\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \scaps\f1\ul\lang1036\kerning28\cgrid {l\rquote infirmi\u232\'8fre\par }\pard\plain \s16\qj\li2835\sa120\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {Vous voyez bien que je n\rquote ai pas le temps\~! Je ne sais pas ce qui se passe, mais c\rquote est une v\u233\'8eritable \u233\'8epid\u233\'8emie\~!\par }\pard\plain \s18\qj\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {Yumi et J\u233\'8er\u233\'8emie regardent autour d\rquote eux et aper\u231\'8doivent Jim, allong\u233\'8e sur un lit.\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s20 \scaps\f1\kerning28 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 93 - \tab}}\pard\plain \s20\qj\li2835\sb120\keepn\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\outlinelevel0\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \scaps\f1\ul\lang1036\kerning28\cgrid {yumi\par }\pard\plain \s16\qj\li2835\sa120\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {Vous voulez qu\rquote on reste pour vous aider\~?\par }\pard\plain \s18\qj\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {L\rquote infirmi\u232\'8fre s\rquote arr\u234\'90te et se retourne vers les deux ados\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s20 \scaps\f1\kerning28 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 94 - \tab}}\pard\plain \s20\qj\li2835\sb120\keepn\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\outlinelevel0\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \scaps\f1\ul\lang1036\kerning28\cgrid {l\rquote infirmi\u232\'8fre\par }\pard\plain \s16\qj\li2835\sa120\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {Si vous voulez m\rquote aider, ne tra\u238\'94nez plus dans mes jambes\~!\par }\pard\plain \s18\qj\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {L\rquote infirmi\u232\'8fre repart s\rquote occuper des \u233\'8el\u232\'8fves. \par Yumi et J\u233\'8er\u233\'8emie se regardent, d\u233\'8esol\u233\'8es, et quittent la pi\u232\'8fce.\par {\pntext\pard\plain\s17 \b\caps\f1 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 14.\tab}}\pard\plain \s17\qj\fi-360\li360\sb240\sa120\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx360{\*\pn \pnlvlbody\ilvl0\ls2\pnrnot0\pndec\pnstart1\pnindent360\pnsp120\pnhang{\pntxta .}}\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls2\adjustright\rin0\lin360\itap0 \b\caps\f1\ul\lang1036\cgrid {ext. bibliotheque \endash  jour\par }\pard\plain \s18\qj\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {Yumi et J\u233\'8er\u233\'8emie sortent juste au moment o\u249\'9d Odd les rejoint, essouffl\u233\'8e.\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s20 \scaps\f1\kerning28 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 95 - \tab}}\pard\plain \s20\qj\li2835\sb120\keepn\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\outlinelevel0\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \scaps\f1\ul\lang1036\kerning28\cgrid {odd (haletant)\par }\pard\plain \s16\qj\li2835\sa120\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {Effectivement\u8230\'c9 Ulrich est s\u233\'8ev\u232\'8frement amn\u233\'8esique\~! Il a failli me casser la figure\~!\par }\pard\plain \s18\qj\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {Yumi d\u233\'8esigne l\rquote infirmerie d\rquote un geste du pouce.\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s20 \scaps\f1\kerning28 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 96 - \tab}}\pard\plain \s20\qj\li2835\sb120\keepn\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\outlinelevel0\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \scaps\f1\ul\lang1036\kerning28\cgrid {Yumi\par }\pard\plain \s16\qj\li2835\sa120\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {Oui\u8230\'c9 et il n\rquote est pas le seul touch\u233\'8e\~!\par }\pard\plain \s18\qj\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {Mine soucieuse de J\u233\'8er\u233\'8emie.\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s20 \scaps\f1\kerning28 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 97 - \tab}}\pard\plain \s20\qj\li2835\sb120\keepn\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\outlinelevel0\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \scaps\f1\ul\lang1036\kerning28\cgrid {j\u233\'8er\u233\'8emie\par }\pard\plain \s16\qj\li2835\sa120\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {On ne devient pas amn\u233\'8esique comme \u231\'8da, d\rquote une seconde \u224\'88 l\rquote autre\~! C\rquote est super bizarre\~!\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s20 \scaps\f1\kerning28 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 98 - \tab}}\pard\plain \s20\qj\li2835\sb120\keepn\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\outlinelevel0\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \scaps\f1\ul\lang1036\kerning28\cgrid {Yumi\par }\pard\plain \s16\qj\li2835\sa120\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {Faudrait tout de suite l\rquote emmener voir un m\u233\'8edecin\~! \par }\pard\plain \s18\qj\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {Odd hoche la t\u234\'90te.\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s20 \scaps\f1\kerning28 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 99 - \tab}}\pard\plain \s20\qj\li2835\sb120\keepn\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\outlinelevel0\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \scaps\f1\ul\lang1036\kerning28\cgrid {Odd\par }\pard\plain \s16\qj\li2835\sa120\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {Dommage que les nano docteurs n\rquote existent pas encore\~!\par }\pard\plain \s18\qj\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {J\u233\'8er\u233\'8emie se retourne vers lui en \u233\'8ecarquillant les yeux.\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s20 \scaps\f1\kerning28 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 100 - \tab}}\pard\plain \s20\qj\li2835\sb120\keepn\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\outlinelevel0\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \scaps\f1\ul\lang1036\kerning28\cgrid {j\u233\'8er\u233\'8emie\par }\pard\plain \s16\qj\li2835\sa120\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {Les nano\u8230\'c9 mais bien s\u251\'9er\~!!\par }\pard\plain \s18\qj\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {J\u233\'8er\u233\'8emie part alors en courant vers les salles de cours. \par Odd et Yumi se regardent un instant, \u233\'8etonn\u233\'8es, puis s\rquote \u233\'8elancent derri\u232\'8fre J\u233\'8er\u233\'8emie.\par {\pntext\pard\plain\s17 \b\caps\f1 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 15.\tab}}\pard\plain \s17\qj\fi-360\li360\sb240\sa120\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx360{\*\pn \pnlvlbody\ilvl0\ls2\pnrnot0\pndec\pnstart1\pnindent360\pnsp120\pnhang{\pntxta .}}\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls2\adjustright\rin0\lin360\itap0 \b\caps\f1\ul\lang1036\cgrid {int. salle de physique chimie - jour \par }\pard\plain \s18\qj\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {J\u233\'8er\u233\'8emie, Yumi et Odd entrent dans la salle de cours pour trouver Mme Hertz \u233\'8evanouie sur son bureau. \par Tandis que Yumi et Odd vont vers elle, J\u233\'8er\u233\'8emie rejoint la table de travail o\u249\'9d se trouve la nano sph\u232\'8fre.\par Yumi secoue d\u233\'8elicatement le professeur.\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s20 \scaps\f1\kerning28 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 101 - \tab}}\pard\plain \s20\qj\li2835\sb120\keepn\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\outlinelevel0\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \scaps\f1\ul\lang1036\kerning28\cgrid {yumi\par }\pard\plain \s16\qj\li2835\sa120\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {Mme Hertz\u8230\'c9\~!\par }\pard\plain \s18\qj\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {La professeur se r\u233\'8eveille, rel\u232\'8fve la t\u234\'90te, regarde les enfants puis regarde autour d\rquote elle.\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s20 \scaps\f1\kerning28 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 102 - \tab}}\pard\plain \s20\qj\li2835\sb120\keepn\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\outlinelevel0\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \scaps\f1\ul\lang1036\kerning28\cgrid {mme hertz\par }\pard\plain \s16\qj\li2835\sa120\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {O\u249\'9d\u8230\'c9 o\u249\'9d suis-je ?\par }\pard\plain \s18\qj\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {Yumi et Odd se regardent, inquiets. Soudain\u8230\'c9\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s20 \scaps\f1\kerning28 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 103 - \tab}}\pard\plain \s20\qj\li2835\sb120\keepn\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\outlinelevel0\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \scaps\f1\ul\lang1036\kerning28\cgrid {j\u233\'8er\u233\'8emie off\par }\pard\plain \s16\qj\li2835\sa120\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {Venez voir\~!\par }\pard\plain \s18\qj\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {Yumi et Odd rejoignent J\u233\'8er\u233\'8emie qui se tient devant un microscope reli\u233\'8e \u224\'88 un ordinateur. \par Il a d\u233\'8ej\u224\'88 la spatule sur laquelle a \u233\'8et\u233\'8e d\u233\'8epos\u233\'8ee la g\u233\'8elatine dans la main, et la place sous la lentille du microscope.\par Odd et Yumi viennent se placer derri\u232\'8fre lui, et regardent l\rquote \u233\'8ecran par-dessus son \u233\'8epaule. \par Sur celui-ci, appara\u238\'94t d\rquote abord une image floue. \par J\u233\'8er\u233\'8emie effectue quelques r\u233\'8eglages\u8230\'c9 et les nano virus apparaissent alors, gesticulants dans la p\u226\'89te.\par Yumi et Odd \u233\'8ecarquillent les yeux.\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s20 \scaps\f1\kerning28 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 104 - \tab}}\pard\plain \s20\qj\li2835\sb120\keepn\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\outlinelevel0\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \scaps\f1\ul\lang1036\kerning28\cgrid {odd\par }\pard\plain \s16\qj\li2835\sa120\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {Beurk\~!\u8230\'c9 Qu\rquote est-ce que c\rquote est que ces bestioles\~??!!!\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s20 \scaps\f1\kerning28 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 105 - \tab}}\pard\plain \s20\qj\li2835\sb120\keepn\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\outlinelevel0\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \scaps\f1\ul\lang1036\kerning28\cgrid {j\u233\'8er\u233\'8emie\par }\pard\plain \s16\qj\li2835\sa120\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {Ce que je craignais\~: des nano virus\~! Sans doute cr\u233\'8e\u233\'8es par XANA\~pour s'attaquer aux cellules de la m\u233\'8emoire\~!\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s20 \scaps\f1\kerning28 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 106 - \tab}}\pard\plain \s20\qj\li2835\sb120\keepn\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\outlinelevel0\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \scaps\f1\ul\lang1036\kerning28\cgrid {yumi\par }\pard\plain \s16\qj\li2835\sa120\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {Mais, comment passent-ils de corps en corps\~? \par {\listtext\pard\plain\s20 \scaps\f1\kerning28 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 107 - \tab}}\pard\plain \s20\qj\li2835\sb120\keepn\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\outlinelevel0\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \scaps\f1\ul\lang1036\kerning28\cgrid {j\u233\'8er\u233\'8emie\par }\pard\plain \s16\qj\li2835\sa120\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {Comme tous les virus : nourriture, contact, \u233\'8eternuements\u8230\'c9 Bient\u244\'99t, tout le coll\u232\'8fge sera atteint, nous compris.\par }\pard\plain \s18\qj\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {Mine affol\u233\'8ee d\rquote Odd.\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s20 \scaps\f1\kerning28 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 108 - \tab}}\pard\plain \s20\qj\li2835\sb120\keepn\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\outlinelevel0\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \scaps\f1\ul\lang1036\kerning28\cgrid {odd\par }\pard\plain \s16\qj\li2835\sa120\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {\u8230\'c9 Un monde sans m\u233\'8emoire\~!\par }\pard\plain \s18\qj\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {Yumi acquiesce gravement.\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s20 \scaps\f1\kerning28 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 109 - \tab}}\pard\plain \s20\qj\li2835\sb120\keepn\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\outlinelevel0\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \scaps\f1\ul\lang1036\kerning28\cgrid {yumi\par }\pard\plain \s16\qj\li2835\sa120\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {Contr\u244\'99l\u233\'8e par XANA\~!\par }\pard\plain \s18\qj\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {J\u233\'8er\u233\'8emie se dirige d\u233\'8ej\u224\'88 vers la porte.\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s20 \scaps\f1\kerning28 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 110 - \tab}}\pard\plain \s20\qj\li2835\sb120\keepn\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\outlinelevel0\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \scaps\f1\ul\lang1036\kerning28\cgrid {J\u233\'8er\u233\'8emie\par }\pard\plain \s16\qj\li2835\sa120\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {Bon\u8230\'c9 on fonce \u224\'88 l\rquote usine\~! Aelita est peut-\u234\'90tre en danger\~sur Lyok\u244\'99 ! \par }\pard\plain \s18\qj\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {J\u233\'8er\u233\'8emie se l\u232\'8fve et, suivi de Yumi, fonce vers la sortie. \par Odd reste un instant plant\u233\'8e, sans rien dire.\par Yumi et J\u233\'8er\u233\'8emie se retournent vers lui.\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s20 \scaps\f1\kerning28 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 111 - \tab}}\pard\plain \s20\qj\li2835\sb120\keepn\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\outlinelevel0\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \scaps\f1\ul\lang1036\kerning28\cgrid {odd\par }\pard\plain \s16\qj\li2835\sa120\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {Et Ulrich\~? On a besoin de lui\~!\par }\pard\plain \s18\qj\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {Yumi et J\u233\'8er\u233\'8emie s\rquote arr\u234\'90tent.\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s20 \scaps\f1\kerning28 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 112 - \tab}}\pard\plain \s20\qj\li2835\sb120\keepn\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\outlinelevel0\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \scaps\f1\ul\lang1036\kerning28\cgrid {yumi (grave)\par }\pard\plain \s16\qj\li2835\sa120\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {Non\u8230\'c9 c\rquote est lui qui a besoin de nous\~! Pour l\rquote aider \u224\'88 retrouver sa m\u233\'8emoire, faut qu\rquote on d\u233\'8esactive la tour\~!\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s20 \scaps\f1\kerning28 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 113 - \tab}}\pard\plain \s20\qj\li2835\sb120\keepn\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\outlinelevel0\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \scaps\f1\ul\lang1036\kerning28\cgrid {j\u233\'8er\u233\'8emie \par }\pard\plain \s16\qj\li2835\sa120\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {Yumi a raison\~! De plus, sans m\u233\'8emoire, il sera plus un boulet qu\rquote une aide\~!\par }\pard\plain \s18\qj\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {Odd hoche tristement la t\u234\'90te, et rejoint ses camarades. Tous trois quittent la salle en courant.\par {\pntext\pard\plain\s17 \b\caps\f1 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 16.\tab}}\pard\plain \s17\qj\fi-360\li360\sb240\sa120\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx360{\*\pn \pnlvlbody\ilvl0\ls2\pnrnot0\pndec\pnstart1\pnindent360\pnsp120\pnhang{\pntxta .}}\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls2\adjustright\rin0\lin360\itap0 \b\caps\f1\ul\lang1036\cgrid {int. couloir des dortoirs \endash  jour\par }\pard\plain \s18\qj\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {Ulrich marche dans le couloir en regardant autour de lui, d\u233\'8ecouvrant les lieux. Il semble perdu. Il croise un \u233\'8el\u232\'8fve qui semble paniqu\u233\'8e, et l\rquote arr\u234\'90te.\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s20 \scaps\f1\kerning28 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 114 - \tab}}\pard\plain \s20\qj\li2835\sb120\keepn\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\outlinelevel0\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \scaps\f1\ul\lang1036\kerning28\cgrid {Ulrich\par }\pard\plain \s16\qj\li2835\sa120\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {Excuse-moi\u8230\'c9 Ma chambre est dans le coin\~?\par }\pard\plain \s18\qj\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {L\rquote \u233\'8el\u232\'8fve le regarde, inquiet.\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s20 \scaps\f1\kerning28 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 115 - \tab}}\pard\plain \s20\qj\li2835\sb120\keepn\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\outlinelevel0\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \scaps\f1\ul\lang1036\kerning28\cgrid {l\rquote \u233\'8el\u232\'8fve\par }\pard\plain \s16\qj\li2835\sa120\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {Ma parole, ils sont devenus tous fous dans ce coll\u232\'8fge. Troisi\u232\'8fme porte \u224\'88 droite. \par }\pard\plain \s18\qj\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {Ulrich r\u233\'8epond avec un signe de t\u234\'90te en guise de remerciement, et se dirige vers sa chambre.\par {\pntext\pard\plain\s17 \b\caps\f1 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 17.\tab}}\pard\plain \s17\qj\fi-360\li360\sb240\sa120\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx360{\*\pn \pnlvlbody\ilvl0\ls2\pnrnot0\pndec\pnstart1\pnindent360\pnsp120\pnhang{\pntxta .}}\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls2\adjustright\rin0\lin360\itap0 \b\caps\f1\ul\lang1036\cgrid {int. chambre d\rquote Ulrich et Odd - jour\par }\pard\plain \s18\qj\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {Ulrich entre dans sa chambre. \par Il y est accueilli par Kiwi qui lui fait aussit\u244\'99t la f\u234\'90te. Ulrich se baisse et caresse machinalement le chien, les sourcils fronc\u233\'8es. \par {\listtext\pard\plain\s20 \scaps\f1\kerning28 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 116 - \tab}}\pard\plain \s20\qj\li2835\sb120\keepn\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\outlinelevel0\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \scaps\f1\ul\lang1036\kerning28\cgrid {ulrich\par }\pard\plain \s16\qj\li2835\sa120\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {Je ne sais pas qui tu es, mais apparemment, on est copains\~!\par }\pard\plain \s18\qj\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {Ulrich se redresse et regarde autour de lui. Il remarque une photo pos\u233\'8ee sur le bureau. Il s\rquote en approche, la prend dans ses mains et l\rquote observe\~: il s\rquote agit des quatre amis, souriant dans une pose comique.\par Ulrich s\rquote assoit sur un lit et examine la photo, l\rquote air perplexe. En off, on entend les rires et \u233\'8eclats de voix des quatre amis, comme s\rquote ils r\u233\'8esonnaient dans sa m\u233\'8emoire.\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s20 \scaps\f1\kerning28 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 117 - \tab}}\pard\plain \s20\qj\li2835\sb120\keepn\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\outlinelevel0\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \scaps\f1\ul\lang1036\kerning28\cgrid {les quatre, off\par }\pard\plain \s16\qj\li2835\sa120\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {\i Rires\par {\pntext\pard\plain\s17 \b\caps\f1 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 18.\tab}}\pard\plain \s17\qj\fi-360\li360\sb240\sa120\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx360{\*\pn \pnlvlbody\ilvl0\ls2\pnrnot0\pndec\pnstart1\pnindent360\pnsp120\pnhang{\pntxta .}}\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls2\adjustright\rin0\lin360\itap0 \b\caps\f1\ul\lang1036\cgrid {ext. parc - jour\par }\pard\plain \s18\qj\widctlpar{\*\pn \pnlvlcont\ilvl0\ls0\pnrnot0\pndec }\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {J\u233\'8er\u233\'8emie, Yumi et Odd courent dans le parc. \par Ils croisent de nouveaux quelques \u233\'8el\u232\'8fves, dont Milly et Tamiya, qui semblent errer sans but. \par Alarm\u233\'8es, ils pressent leur course vers l'acc\u232\'8fs du souterrain.\par {\pntext\pard\plain\s17 \b\caps\f1 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 19.\tab}}\pard\plain \s17\qj\fi-360\li360\sb240\sa120\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx360{\*\pn \pnlvlbody\ilvl0\ls2\pnrnot0\pndec\pnstart1\pnindent360\pnsp120\pnhang{\pntxta .}}\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls2\adjustright\rin0\lin360\itap0 \b\caps\f1\ul\lang1036\cgrid {ext. cour des refectoires - jour\par }\pard\plain \s18\qj\widctlpar{\*\pn \pnlvlcont\ilvl0\ls0\pnrnot0\pndec }\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {Ulrich sort du b\u226\'89timent des dortoirs. \par Il s\rquote arr\u234\'90te un instant pour constater qu\rquote autour de lui, plusieurs \u233\'8el\u232\'8fves et professeurs marchent d\rquote un air hagard. D\rquote autres sont \u233\'8evanouis.\par Soudain, }{\cf6 il ferme les yeux.}{\par {\pntext\pard\plain\s17 \b\caps\f1 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 20.\tab}}\pard\plain \s17\qj\fi-360\li360\sb240\sa120\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx360{\*\pn \pnlvlbody\ilvl0\ls2\pnrnot0\pndec\pnstart1\pnindent360\pnsp120\pnhang{\pntxta .}}\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls2\adjustright\rin0\lin360\itap0 \b\caps\f1\ul\lang1036\cgrid {flash d\rquote Ulrich -  ext. Parc \endash  jour\par }\pard\plain \s19\qj\sb120\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \scaps\f1\ul\lang1036\cgrid {r\u233\'8eut. de l\rquote \u233\'8episode \u171\'c7\~Le voir pour le croire\~\u187\'c8\par }\pard\plain \qj\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {\i Les h\u233\'8eros d\u233\'8eboulent vers la trappe. \par Yumi et Ulrich se jettent aussit\u244\'99t dessus pour l'ouvrir. \par Odd est au t\u233\'8el\u233\'8ephone. \par {\listtext\pard\plain\s1 \i\scaps\f1\kerning28 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 118 - \tab}}\pard\plain \s1\qj\li2835\sb120\keepn\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\outlinelevel0\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \scaps\f1\ul\lang1036\kerning28\cgrid {\i Odd (rassurant)\par }\pard\plain \s16\qj\li2835\sa120\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {\i On arrive, J\u233\'8er\u233\'8emie ! \par }\pard\plain \qj\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {\i Odd raccroche et s'avance en regardant Ulrich qui se jette le premier dans l'ouverture. \par {\pntext\pard\plain\s17 \b\caps\f1 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 21.\tab}}\pard\plain \s17\qj\fi-360\li360\sb240\sa120\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx360{\*\pn \pnlvlbody\ilvl0\ls2\pnrnot0\pndec\pnstart1\pnindent360\pnsp120\pnhang{\pntxta .}}\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls2\adjustright\rin0\lin360\itap0 \b\caps\f1\ul\lang1036\cgrid {ext. cour \endash  jour\par }\pard\plain \s18\qj\widctlpar{\*\pn \pnlvlcont\ilvl0\ls0\pnrnot0\pndec }\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {Retour au pr\u233\'8esent\par Ulrich rouvre les yeux, regarde vers le parc et s\rquote y dirige d\rquote une d\u233\'8emarche inqui\u232\'8fte.\par {\pntext\pard\plain\s17 \b\caps\f1 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 22.\tab}}\pard\plain \s17\qj\fi-360\li360\sb240\sa120\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx360{\*\pn \pnlvlbody\ilvl0\ls2\pnrnot0\pndec\pnstart1\pnindent360\pnsp120\pnhang{\pntxta .}}\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls2\adjustright\rin0\lin360\itap0 \b\caps\f1\ul\lang1036\cgrid {int. labo - jour\par }\pard\plain \s18\qj\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {Les trois amis sont rassembl\u233\'8es devant l\rquote \u233\'8ecran sur lequel appara\u238\'94t l\rquote image d\rquote A\u233\'8elita.\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s20 \scaps\f1\kerning28 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 119 - \tab}}\pard\plain \s20\qj\li2835\sb120\keepn\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\outlinelevel0\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \scaps\f1\ul\lang1036\kerning28\cgrid {aelita\par }\pard\plain \s16\qj\li2835\sa120\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {Je n\rquote ai rien vu d\rquote alarmant dans les territoires de la for\u234\'90t et du d\u233\'8esert\u8230\'c9\par }\pard\plain \s18\qj\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {J\u233\'8er\u233\'8emie pianote sur ses claviers.\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s20 \scaps\f1\kerning28 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 120 - \tab}}\pard\plain \s20\qj\li2835\sb120\keepn\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\outlinelevel0\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \scaps\f1\ul\lang1036\kerning28\cgrid {j\u233\'8er\u233\'8emie\par }\pard\plain \s16\qj\li2835\sa120\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {OK\u8230\'c9 Tu peux te transf\u233\'8erer sur la montagne\~? J\rquote envoie Yumi et Odd dans la banquise\~! Elle doit bien \u234\'90tre quelque part, cette tour activ\u233\'8ee\~!\par }\pard\plain \s18\qj\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {A\u233\'8elita hoche la t\u234\'90te et dispara\u238\'94t de l\rquote \u233\'8ecran, tandis que Yumi et Odd courent vers la salle des scanners.\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s20 \scaps\f1\kerning28 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 121 - \tab}}\pard\plain \s20\qj\li2835\sb120\keepn\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\outlinelevel0\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \scaps\f1\ul\lang1036\kerning28\cgrid {J\u233\'8er\u233\'8emie\par }\pard\plain \s16\qj\li2835\sa120\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {Pr\u234\'90ts \u224\'88 plonger dans deux minutes\~!\par }\pard\plain \s18\qj\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {J\u233\'8er\u233\'8emie commence \u224\'88 r\u233\'8egler ses appareils.\par {\pntext\pard\plain\s17 \b\caps\f1 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 23.\tab}}\pard\plain \s17\qj\fi-360\li360\sb240\sa120\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx360{\*\pn \pnlvlbody\ilvl0\ls2\pnrnot0\pndec\pnstart1\pnindent360\pnsp120\pnhang{\pntxta .}}\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls2\adjustright\rin0\lin360\itap0 \b\caps\f1\ul\lang1036\cgrid {ext. parc - jour\par }\pard\plain \s18\qj\widctlpar{\*\pn \pnlvlcont\ilvl0\ls0\pnrnot0\pndec }\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {Ulrich marche dans le parc et  arrive devant l\rquote entr\u233\'8ee du souterrain. \par Il s\rquote y arr\u234\'90te, regarde autour de lui, puis de nouveau la trappe et semble r\u233\'8efl\u233\'8echir. Enfin, il ouvre la trappe. \par Il regarde \u224\'88 l\rquote int\u233\'8erieur, toujours plus inquiet. \par Finalement, il soupire et s\rquote y engouffre. \par {\pntext\pard\plain\s17 \b\caps\f1 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 24.\tab}}\pard\plain \s17\qj\fi-360\li360\sb240\sa120\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx360{\*\pn \pnlvlbody\ilvl0\ls2\pnrnot0\pndec\pnstart1\pnindent360\pnsp120\pnhang{\pntxta .}}\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls2\adjustright\rin0\lin360\itap0 \b\caps\f1\ul\lang1036\cgrid {int. salle des scanners - jour\par }\pard\plain \s18\qj\widctlpar{\*\pn \pnlvlcont\ilvl0\ls0\pnrnot0\pndec }\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {Les portes des scanners se ferment sur Odd et Yumi qui en ont int\u233\'8egr\u233\'8e chacun un. Les rayons laser passent sur leur corps, et ils sont virtualis\u233\'8es.\par {\pntext\pard\plain\s17 \b\caps\f1 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 25.\tab}}\pard\plain \s17\qj\fi-360\li360\sb240\sa120\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx360{\*\pn \pnlvlbody\ilvl0\ls2\pnrnot0\pndec\pnstart1\pnindent360\pnsp120\pnhang{\pntxta .}}\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls2\adjustright\rin0\lin360\itap0 \b\caps\f1\ul\lang1036\cgrid {ext. lyok\u244\'99 \endash  banquise\~/ iceberg couloir - jour\par }\pard\plain \s18\qj\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {Yumi et Odd apparaissent sur l'iceberg couloir. \par Une fois les pieds au sol, ils regardent autour d\rquote eux, en alerte. \par Yumi d\u233\'8esigne le sommet de l\rquote iceberg.\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s20 \scaps\f1\kerning28 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 122 - \tab}}\pard\plain \s20\qj\li2835\sb120\keepn\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\outlinelevel0\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \scaps\f1\ul\lang1036\kerning28\cgrid {yumi\par }\pard\plain \s16\qj\li2835\sa120\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {L\u224\'88-haut\~! \u199\'82a nous permettra de rep\u233\'8erer la tour activ\u233\'8ee\~!\par }\pard\plain \s18\qj\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {Odd hoche la t\u234\'90te et tous deux partent eu courant, amor\u231\'8dant la mont\u233\'8ee.\par {\pntext\pard\plain\s17 \b\caps\f1 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 26.\tab}}\pard\plain \s17\qj\fi-360\li360\sb240\sa120\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx360{\*\pn \pnlvlbody\ilvl0\ls2\pnrnot0\pndec\pnstart1\pnindent360\pnsp120\pnhang{\pntxta .}}\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls2\adjustright\rin0\lin360\itap0 \b\caps\f1\ul\lang1036\cgrid {int. labo - jour\par }\pard\plain \s18\qj\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {A\u233\'8elita appara\u238\'94t sur l\rquote \u233\'8ecran, face \u224\'88 J\u233\'8er\u233\'8emie.\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s20 \scaps\f1\kerning28 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 123 - \tab}}\pard\plain \s20\qj\li2835\sb120\keepn\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\outlinelevel0\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \scaps\f1\ul\lang1036\kerning28\cgrid {j\u233\'8er\u233\'8emie\par }\pard\plain \s16\qj\li2835\sa120\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin2835\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {A\u233\'8elita\~? Du nouveau\~?\par }\pard\plain \s18\qj\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f1\lang1036\cgrid {Plan d\rquote Aelita qui r\u233\'8epond.\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s20 \scaps\f1\kerning28 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch